580
00:54:59.420 --> 00:55:02.290
So you'll strip me of my titles

581
00:54:59.420 --> 00:55:02.290
and name Aegon in my stead.

582
00:55:02.390 --> 00:55:03.450
I would.

583
00:55:04.430 --> 00:55:06.660
But it is mine

584
00:55:04.430 --> 00:55:06.660
to hold the realm together.

585
00:55:06.770 --> 00:55:08.600
not sow it with further division.

586
00:55:10.440 --> 00:55:13.060
Your courtship is at an end.

587
00:55:13.140 --> 00:55:15.330
You will wed Ser Laenor Velaryon.

588
00:55:15.440 --> 00:55:17.770
and you will do so without protest.

589
00:55:18.910 --> 00:55:20.850
The son of the Sea Snake.

590
00:55:20.950 --> 00:55:23.440
So I can be a remedy

591
00:55:20.950 --> 00:55:23.440
for your political headaches.

592
00:55:23.520 --> 00:55:25.810
You are my political headache!

593
00:55:30.620 --> 00:55:32.850
Your wedding to Ser Laenor Velaryon

594
00:55:32.960 --> 00:55:35.480
will unite the two most powerful houses

595
00:55:32.960 --> 00:55:35.480
in the realm.

596
00:55:35.590 --> 00:55:39.860
With the combined strength

597
00:55:35.590 --> 00:55:39.860
of our shared dragons and naval fleets.

598
00:55:39.970 --> 00:55:42.630
no one would dare to stand against us.

599
00:55:42.700 --> 00:55:44.030
The House of the Dragon

600
00:55:44.140 --> 00:55:46.610
will stand as one

601
00:55:44.140 --> 00:55:46.610
for a further generation.

602
00:55:46.670 --> 00:55:50.510
And what will you do about the vulture

603
00:55:46.670 --> 00:55:50.510
who perches upon your throne?

604
00:55:51.010 --> 00:55:52.380
What vulture?

605
00:55:52.980 --> 00:55:54.280
Your Hand.

606
00:55:55.880 --> 00:56:00.050
Otto Hightower has served two kings

607
00:55:55.880 --> 00:56:00.050
loyally and faithfully.

608
00:56:01.220 --> 00:56:03.210
He wants Aegon to be named heir.

609
00:56:03.860 --> 00:56:06.490
And he will stop

610
00:56:03.860 --> 00:56:06.490
at nothing to see it done.

611
00:56:06.560 --> 00:56:09.550
Including spying on me

612
00:56:06.560 --> 00:56:09.550
to bring about my ruin.

613
00:56:11.000 --> 00:56:13.560
You speak of The Conqueror's vision

614
00:56:13.670 --> 00:56:16.900
and the need for strength

615
00:56:13.670 --> 00:56:16.900
and unity across the realm.

616
00:56:17.000 --> 00:56:18.630
But how can that be accomplished

617
00:56:18.700 --> 00:56:21.230
with your most trusted adviser

618
00:56:18.700 --> 00:56:21.230
so self-interested?

619
00:56:21.340 --> 00:56:23.810
Every lord and lady that calls

620
00:56:21.340 --> 00:56:23.810
for an audience with me.

621
00:56:23.880 --> 00:56:25.710
every man on my small council.

622
00:56:25.810 --> 00:56:28.750
and all councils past.

623
00:56:25.810 --> 00:56:28.750
has been self-interested.

624
00:56:28.850 --> 00:56:31.320
- It is unavoidable.

625
00:56:28.850 --> 00:56:31.320
- I disagree.

626
00:56:31.380 --> 00:56:35.380
I will do my duty as heir

627
00:56:31.380 --> 00:56:35.380
and wed Ser Laenor.

628
00:56:37.890 --> 00:56:40.660
But you must first do yours as king.

629
00:56:52.070 --> 00:56:53.160
Your Grace.

630
00:56:55.870 --> 00:56:57.070
Five days.

631
00:57:00.410 --> 00:57:02.380
I'm sorry. Your Grace?

632
00:57:02.450 --> 00:57:03.850
Though it was some time ago.

633
00:57:04.920 --> 00:57:07.790
The details... they fade in memory.

634
00:57:08.920 --> 00:57:12.290
My father was a hale and healthy warrior

635
00:57:08.920 --> 00:57:12.290
and dragonrider

636
00:57:12.390 --> 00:57:14.380
at the peak of his abilities.

637
00:57:15.090 --> 00:57:16.790
Jaehaerys named a great royal hunt

638
00:57:16.900 --> 00:57:19.130
to celebrate him being

639
00:57:16.900 --> 00:57:19.130
named the Hand of the King.

640
00:57:21.270 --> 00:57:24.400
Five days later my father lay dead.

641
00:57:26.710 --> 00:57:28.140
Tourneys last longer.

642
00:57:29.910 --> 00:57:32.210
Baelon the Brave.

643
00:57:32.280 --> 00:57:34.370
rider of Vhagar.

644
00:57:34.450 --> 00:57:36.440
heir to the Iron Throne...

645
00:57:37.880 --> 00:57:39.880
dead of a burst belly.

646
00:57:41.720 --> 00:57:43.210
The gods have a dark wit.

647
00:57:44.390 --> 00:57:45.980
It was a grim day.

648
00:57:47.590 --> 00:57:50.220
- I recall it all too well.

649
00:57:47.590 --> 00:57:50.220
Yeah...

650
00:57:51.230 --> 00:57:52.560
It was a good day for you.

651
00:57:54.570 --> 00:57:57.160
Jaehaerys named you Hand

652
00:57:54.570 --> 00:57:57.160
in Baelon's stead.

653
00:58:00.510 --> 00:58:03.500
That's hardly how I viewed it.

654
00:58:00.510 --> 00:58:03.500
Your Grace.

655
00:58:04.340 --> 00:58:05.970
It was a duty.

656
00:58:08.750 --> 00:58:12.510
You served my grandsire

657
00:58:08.750 --> 00:58:12.510
nobly in his final days.

658
00:58:13.920 --> 00:58:16.150
You are the man

659
00:58:13.920 --> 00:58:16.150
that taught me how to be King.

660
00:58:18.120 --> 00:58:20.120
You honor me. Your Grace.

661
00:58:22.290 --> 00:58:23.920
Just five days...

662
00:58:25.700 --> 00:58:28.930
you went from being another man

663
00:58:25.700 --> 00:58:28.930
in Jaehaerys's court.

664
00:58:29.000 --> 00:58:31.030
to the second most

665
00:58:29.000 --> 00:58:31.030
powerful man in the realm.

666
00:58:32.340 --> 00:58:33.530
I wonder...

667
00:58:34.970 --> 00:58:37.770
how long did it take you

668
00:58:34.970 --> 00:58:37.770
to choose yourself over your King?

669
00:58:40.810 --> 00:58:42.210
Your Grace?

670
00:58:43.220 --> 00:58:45.840
I will never recover from Aemma's death.

671
00:58:46.790 --> 00:58:47.980
But Alicent...

672
00:58:48.990 --> 00:58:51.010
she took me

673
00:58:48.990 --> 00:58:51.010
through the worst of my grief.

674
00:58:53.490 --> 00:58:55.480
She was a calculated distraction.

675
00:58:57.360 --> 00:59:00.700
I only now realize

676
00:58:57.360 --> 00:59:00.700
how well-calculated it was.

677
00:59:00.800 --> 00:59:03.030
That is an absurdity.

678
00:59:03.640 --> 00:59:05.190
The Queen loves you...

679
00:59:06.840 --> 00:59:08.830
as I know you love her.

680
00:59:08.910 --> 00:59:12.310
Your interests no longer align

681
00:59:08.910 --> 00:59:12.310
with those of the realm.

682
00:59:12.380 --> 00:59:14.740
Your judgment has been compromised.

683
00:59:14.850 --> 00:59:17.340
A loyal Hand must tell his king

684
00:59:17.420 --> 00:59:20.550
a discomforting truth

685
00:59:17.420 --> 00:59:20.550
from time to time. Your Grace.

686
00:59:20.650 --> 00:59:21.810
If he doesn't...

687
00:59:23.660 --> 00:59:25.650
he's failed as a servant.

688
00:59:26.690 --> 00:59:29.060
You were a faithful servant. Otto.

689
00:59:38.670 --> 00:59:40.070
The Crown and the realm

690
00:59:40.670 --> 00:59:43.670
both owe you a debt

691
00:59:40.670 --> 00:59:43.670
that can never be repaid.

692
00:59:44.840 --> 00:59:47.400
But I can no longer trust your judgment.

693
01:00:11.870 --> 01:00:12.960
Come.

694
01:00:17.780 --> 01:00:20.770
I hope you can forgive

695
01:00:17.780 --> 01:00:20.770
the late hour. Princess.

696
01:00:25.650 --> 01:00:28.640
I took great care in its preparation.

697
01:00:31.320 --> 01:00:34.230
If not brewed properly.

698
01:00:31.320 --> 01:00:34.230
it can either prove ineffective

699
01:00:34.290 --> 01:00:38.390
- or else bear unpleasant--

700
01:00:34.290 --> 01:00:38.390
- Brewed properly?

701
01:00:40.230 --> 01:00:41.830
I'm sorry. what is that?

702
01:00:42.570 --> 01:00:44.560
A tea. Princess.

703
01:00:45.170 --> 01:00:46.600
From the King.

704
01:00:47.910 --> 01:00:53.110
It will rid you of any

705
01:00:47.910 --> 01:00:53.110
unwanted consequences.
